<title>UK: CRICKET-WORCESTERSHIRE BEAT AUSTRALIA IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WORCESTERSHIRE BEAT AUSTRALIA IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, England 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worcestershire beat Australia by five wickets in their one-day (50 overs) match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 121 all out in 35 overs (D.Leatherdale 5-10, G.Haynes 4-40). Worcestershire 123-5 in 38.5 overs.</p>
